---
import NewsletterSignup from '../components/NewsletterSignup.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Newsletter"
	description="New essays on work, ambition and career decisions, sent to your inbox. Free, no noise."
>
	<div class="reading">
		<header class="page-header">
			<h1>Newsletter</h1>
		</header>

		<!-- TODO: confirm the cadence below matches what you actually send. -->
		<div class="prose">
			<p>
				Every new essay goes to subscribers first. They are about work, ambition, discipline and the
				career decisions that feel too big to talk about at the office, written by someone making one
				of those decisions in real time.
			</p>
			<p>
				It arrives <strong>every other Sunday</strong>: one essay, sometimes a short note on what I’m
				reading or thinking about. No sponsored posts, no link roundups, no daily noise.
			</p>
			<p>It’s free, and you can unsubscribe in one click whenever you like.</p>
		</div>

		<NewsletterSignup placement="newsletter" class="signup" />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.signup {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}
</style>
